age keeps the testing-20261117.1 baseline\nfor every other package and takes only the aura RPM from\ntesting-20261120.2, by exact size and sha256 (c103c841), with its\nAurora signature and the 1.0.0b13-g2f487f26 version string in\nm1n1.bin checked. That m1n1.bin is what the payload's ESP Stage 2\nfiles are built from.\n\nThe repository receipt lists aura with the signed packages and records\nthe m1n1.bin digest; the image proof requires the -3 aura installed and\npins m1n1.bin (both paths, one hard-linked file) in its file inventory.\nThe kernel and Mesa bytes are unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Diljit Singh <hey@djdev.me>","timestamp":"2026-11-21T00:26:44Z","author":{"name":"Diljit Singh","email":"hey@djdev.me"},"committer":{"name":"Diljit Singh","email":"hey@djdev.me"}},"repository":{"id":1424217559,"node_id":"R_kgDOVOPV1w","name":"fedora-aurora","full_name":"aurora-silicon/fedora-aurora","private":false,"owner":{"login":"aurora-silicon","id":311409036,"node_id":"O_kgDOEo-5jA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/311409036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon","html_url":"https://github.com/aurora-silicon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurora-silicon/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/aurora-silicon/fedora-aurora","descr